{
  "version": "19.0.4",
  "name": "@rxap/ngx-changelog",
  "description": "This package provides Angular components and services to display changelogs within an application. It fetches changelog data from a remote source and presents it in a user-friendly dialog or component, allowing users to view updates and changes. The package also includes features to remember the last viewed version and disable the changelog display.\n",
